 "observations": [
  {
   "detail": "The wheel declares <3.14,>=3.12. Left to choose for itself, uv 0.10.2 (Homebrew 2026-02-10) built the tool environment on 3.14.7, which the package says it does not support. All five commands pass on it anyway, so this is not a release stop, but a clean-machine install can land on an interpreter outside the tested range without saying so. The first install pins 3.12 and is the supported path. Unchanged in kind from the pre-0029 report: the same host, the same uv, the same outcome.",
   "id": "default_interpreter_ignores_requires_python",
   "severity": "note for Gate 2"
  }
